    dcterms:description "Adient site 11 (PL, tier-2 internal, metal structures making): inbound logistic routes from sites 16, 291, 322, 34, 35, 959 with freight mode, lead time, distance, truck capacities, receiving and empty-return frequencies and full-truck cost."@en ;
